  "prefLabel": "Pda 101.35 State-owned commercial pier",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 101.35 “State-owned commercial pier” means “state-owned commercial pier” as defined in RSA 12-G:2, XXIII-a, namely, “any business-use or recreational-use pier owned by the state and located at Portsmouth, Rye Harbor, or Hampton Harbor.”\n\nSource. #8760, eff 11-18-06",
